  pmem_memory_bandwidth_total
       [Intel(R) Optane(TM) Persistent Memory(PMEM) memory bandwidth (MB/sec)]
  pmem_memory_bandwidth_write
       [Intel(R) Optane(TM) Persistent Memory(PMEM) memory write bandwidth
